{"server":"cn","storyId":"act36side_level_act36side_05_end","groupId":"act36side","stageId":"act36side_05","title":"会饮图","storyCode":"DT-5","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act36side/level_act36side_05_end.txt","sourceHash":"92cda031ff26da11ac6d982411115425ff5ed452137f2d0ce2c858e48378033d","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我跟着法琳走进了那座山洞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那里，我才知道，她的秘诀究竟是什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，她还告诉了我所谓的“生态”是什么，在那一刻，我才第一次知道自己原来是那么地缺乏实践。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也是在那一天，我和法琳成了好朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"人生得一知己，夫复何求？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"这位法琳妹妹，对你来说一定很重要吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，她是我最好的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，你不应该去找她吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得你说过，她被炎龙吃掉了，但是，你们有办法复活她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炎龙......炎龙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们会去的，到时候，我会把她带来婆山镇见一见你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"也好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，今天来得似乎有些频繁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......该不会是莱欧斯那家伙捅了什么娄子吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去看看！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，我能做的......也只有这么多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"莱欧斯小哥，看来你的伙伴们，只能靠你了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，玛露西尔妹妹？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怪了，明明钟声响了，但是，却没有墨魉来袭击镇子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱欧斯也没有回来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"......欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，喜欢吃杏子的话，那就跑起来！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莱欧斯说着，把采来的一把杏子往远处一丢，只见一群大大小小的兽形墨魉都向着杏子跑去。\n看着它们抢杏子的光景，莱欧斯开心极了，他几乎要把这群家伙当成自己家里养的狗了。\n对，简直就和奴莎、亚诺特里德、波夫、福奇、抹布和木木一样！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"呆呆的墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别急，你们的份也少不了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"对于这种有点像树懒的墨魉，莱欧斯自然不会选择让它们争抢。\n他已经摸清楚了这种墨魉的喜好，特意摘了一堆水果，堆在那里让它们放肆地吃。\n它们吃饱了就会躺下，背上的颜色也会变......\n看着它们挺着圆滚滚的肚子还要奋力往嘴里塞果子的样子，莱欧斯很好奇，真的会有人不喜欢这群小家伙吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠哉的墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我怎么会忘了你们呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"乌龟一样的墨魉可以说是莱欧斯现在最好奇的墨魉了，一开始，他还以为它们是一大块石头，直到自己一屁股坐了上去。\n这种墨魉的性子和乌龟如出一辙，而最有趣的是，如果你让它们吃饱了，它们背上的假山会流下泉水——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"远处雷声隆隆。\n墨魉们听到雷声，纷纷想要站起来。\n可是，它们发现自己站不起来......原因很简单——\n它们吃得太撑了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来今年的收成会很不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"多亏了你啊，森西老爷子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"要是没有你，我看这收成至少得少一半！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫也只是把自己知道的知识运用起来罢了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"森西，别种田了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛露西尔，怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱欧斯自从上次跑去镇子外面找墨魉后，好几天没回来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱欧斯？他喜欢研究，就让他去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，最近墨魉都没有来攻击镇子了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他会不会出事了？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......反正我们要在这里待很久，不妨再等一等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不对......我们不能在这里待很久！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们要一起去打败炎龙、救出法琳的啊，你忘了吗？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛露西尔，说到这里，我们在这座镇子里待多久了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们又饿了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼，真是群贪心的家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，今天也少不了你们的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，今天我们要来做一件不一样的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"呆呆的墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎——嘎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欢快的墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜嘎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠哉的墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到那边的山顶了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在那里放了许多你们最爱的果子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是想吃的话，就要靠自己的力量去争取！这是自然界的铁则！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎嘎——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白了的话，那么，三、二、一——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"跑起来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"随着莱欧斯的话音落下，墨魉们争先恐后地向着山顶方向跑了起来——除了乌龟形的墨魉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠哉的墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？你这是想要让我坐上去吗？你愿意驮着我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，真聪明，知道与其和它们抢，不如讨好我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠哉的墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好好好，都有份，都有份。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"山中无日月。\n莱欧斯已经明白，雷声会引得墨魉们下山去攻击镇子。\n但这件事并不是绝对的，墨魉们的习性并不会因此被抹去。\n那么，为什么不让墨魉们尽可能远离镇子呢？\n这就是他正在做的事，从山顶跑到山脚，可比从山腰跑下去远多了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_landscape"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......嗝......这酒真不错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您就说，服不服吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不服！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就再来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"齐尔查克！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？玛露西尔，你怎么来了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别喝了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱欧斯已经不知道多久没回来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近墨魉们也几乎不再进攻了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一定是他做了什么！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就让他做去吧，我要喝酒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"果然，齐尔查克的状况和我们之前完全一样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，他几乎要把自己当成镇子里的一员了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......齐尔查克，你还记得我们来到这座镇子多久了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记得我们的目的是救出法琳吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记得你最讨厌宝箱怪吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘶，呃，我的头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也反应过来了吗？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"齐尔查克，你还好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎嘎，嘎？（所以你们都叫什么？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"呆呆的墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欢快的墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"悠哉的墨魉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎嘎呜！莱欧斯！（原来如此，你们的名字分别是，阿咬、小躁，还有偷闲？我叫莱欧斯！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿咬","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜嘎，嘎嘎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小躁","speakerId":"avg_npc_1427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎嘎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷闲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎唔嘎呜嘎嘎！（嗯，我们当然是好朋友！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"寒尽不知年。\n莱欧斯已经不在乎雷声是否响起了。\n如今，他已经和这群墨魉成为好朋友，他们同吃同住，每天一起摘果子，一起在山林里奔跑嬉戏。\n他甚至能听明白它们在说些什么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定莱欧斯在这里吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道......但是，墨魉们应该就是从这个方向来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果莱欧斯一直在研究它们的话，我猜他一定会在这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果按你说的，自从他来了这里以后，墨魉们的进攻就变得少了许多......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难道说，是他做了什么事阻止了墨魉的攻击......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我总觉得，他可能只是跑去和那些墨魉不知道玩什么去了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......还是赶紧先找到他究竟在哪里吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莱欧斯跟它们一起生活得越是久，越是理解这种名为“墨魉”的“生物”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......该回去告诉其他人这个事实了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们大概会很惊讶吧，毕竟——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿咬","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎哦！（跟我一起来吧，我要给你们介绍一下我的几个同伴。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小躁","speakerId":"avg_npc_1427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜嘎——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜嘎嘎！（放心，他们都是好人，不会伤害你们的——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"偷闲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1425_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——嘎——（嗯，他们一定也会喜欢你的！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱欧斯，我们来帮"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在救伙伴心切的三人看来，极端诡异的一幕出现了。\n他们着急寻找的莱欧斯——\n此时正四肢着地，像是野生动物一样趴在地上，用他们根本无法理解的语言和墨魉们交流着。\n他们感觉到，心里有某种东西碎了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜嘎嘎！（啊，你们来得正好！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，不好意思，用它们的语言久了，差点不会说人话了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......对不起，是我们打扰了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，你们别走啊，我有很重要的发现要告诉你们！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，我们就不打扰您在这里享福了，我们会自己寻找离开的方法的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要告诉你们的，就和离开的方法有关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......什么意思？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们看着吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朋友们，开饭了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"墨魉们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——！（快活地跑向各种水果）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这、这......你用这些水果驯服了墨魉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿咬","speakerId":"avg_npc_143","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它怎么变色了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是它的特性，阿咬吃饱了会变色。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它叫阿咬？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那个小狗一样的墨魉叫小躁，乌龟一样的叫偷闲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你起的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们告诉我的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿咬","speakerId":"avg_npc_1422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎嘎——呕——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呜哇，不仅是喂饱了，这只吃太多都吐了！而且吐出来的颜色好鲜艳，有点恶心——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？好熟悉的......酒香......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"森西，你干什么！那可是魔物吐出来的东西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是果酒的味道，嗯......闻起来发酵得很不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......尝起来味道也不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要乱吃东西啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别急，你们听。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"听什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肚子里晃晃荡荡的声音。这个里面是酒，这个里面像是果酱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再来看这个。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它吃了果子之后背上的假山也开始有泉水流动了，嗯......这些渗出来的东西，唔哦，好清爽的口感，是果汁！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可这和离开这里有什么关系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等会儿你就知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"森西，你有带能装果酱和饮料的容器吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有，最近每天要和镇里人喝酒，搞得我随身带了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别告诉我你们想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别告诉我你们要......！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，不过这些果酱人吃的话还是要加一点糖调味才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些果汁的话......虽然味道都很清爽，但是口感还是有点单调。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以像这样，把适合搭配在一起的果汁混合起来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也加入一些糖调味，搅拌均匀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......最后用玻璃瓶盛起来，放上点水果点缀——好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都来尝尝吧，老夫改良后的墨魉果酒、果酱和果汁！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，这果酒还真的是别有一番风味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是糖的摄入量肯定超标了，今天要多干一些活消耗掉才好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不想和你们这些会吃呕吐物的人说话......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蜂蜜其实就是蜜蜂的呕吐物哦，玛露西尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔像背上的蔬菜也是由迷宫中人们的排泄物浇灌——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——我不听！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莱欧斯，你怎么了？从刚才开始你就一言不发的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，我想说说我的想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我追着那只长了痣的墨魉去了镇子外面，却发现它们居然能停下攻击然后开开心心地偷吃水果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么意思......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魔物会袭击人类，虽然有的时候是出于天生的攻击性......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是大部分时候还有更确切的原因，比如领地受到侵犯，或者因为一些事情被激怒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算是因为饥饿而袭击镇子，它们进食的状态也不会像现在这样温和。你看它们，一副温顺亲人的模样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小躁","speakerId":"avg_npc_1427_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎汪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还流了满地的口水，湿答答的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，镇里人对于墨魉的习性毫不了解其实也非常奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们才来没多久就发现了喂水果这个方法，但镇民们和墨魉这么频繁地接触，就算是不想做，最后也应该迫不得已地去了解并制定对策。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是镇里人却没有这么做，就好像这么做没有必要一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有可能他们试过了，但是没学会？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就更奇怪了，他们既没有搬离这个会被骚扰的、不适合生活的地方，也没有学会我们使用的这种攻击方式......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他们是怎么在这里一直生活下去的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们发现了吗？墨魉们甚至没有被我们找到一个“窝”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，它们还会不断地死而复生，就好像......这里的一切都是“假的”一样！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"......唔，有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黎小姐？你是什么时候......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"愿闻其详。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在我们来的地方，传说是一个叫作“狂乱魔法师”的家伙，用自己庞大的魔力创造了迷宫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那座迷宫里，存在着各种各样的魔物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但那些魔物并不是孤立的，它们会互相影响，有的互相捕食，有的互相利用，有的互相依赖共生——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都平等地处于同一个生态圈中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论狂乱魔法师是个什么样的人，能做到这一点，我认为都是非常了不起的。而这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得，能够制造这样一个栩栩如生的世界的人，一定也是个非常厉害的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿咬","speakerId":"avg_npc_1422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（吧唧着嘴流口水）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想......那个人既然创造了这些墨魉，又为什么没有给它们设计一套更加完整的生态系统？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们的窝长什么样？怎样繁衍？不同样貌的墨魉之间是怎么交流的？又和这里的人有怎样的关系？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我真的十分好奇，但一直都没能看到。那个人究竟为什么要设计这些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我还发现了这个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它们藏起了一筐山楂，却一直没有吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"......山楂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）山楂......吗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）......我都没有发现呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，一点自言自语罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"只是......原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"你所在意的事物之间的勾连，彼此互证，你我皆为对方的镜子，对你来说，这才是你理解的“真”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛露西尔，为什么老夫完全没听懂他们两个人的对话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......嗯......虽然我也很想这样说，但是总觉得又有点听懂了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"......噗哈哈哈，有意思，有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"是了，天地万物皆有其理，画中亦有众生百态，墨魉当然也该有其来处，有其去处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"既然墨魉只是无根浮萍，则破绽自现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"古往今来，不是没有人因此发现此间不过画中境，但是......如此笃定的发言倒是很久没有听过了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"这何尝不是一种“看山还是山，看水还是水”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"说着，黎不知为何转身，看向天空。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"这也算是参破了此间之妙吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这幅画怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原本画的明明是山水，怎么变成了这个样子......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这腌臜墨团，这水渍，这红紫斑驳......谁来过我的房间？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"难不成是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这次倒不是我那“好姐姐”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有意思，是荒野上的精怪的手笔吗。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_plankroad"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇！怎么突然打这么大的雷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀呀，看来是真生气了呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？谁？谁生气了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"怪不得，这么多墨魉都被吸引过来了，还醉得歪七扭八，这副样子也是第一次见呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黎小姐，你在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们看！天上掉下来了一个人？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔......不像是掉下来的，像是飞过来的......看起来有点生气，是创造这里的魔法师吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊啊啊，一定是莱欧斯口无遮拦惹怒了她！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我也没说什么啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"别怕，这只是有些特别的......送客之道，并不是要置你们于死地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"墨魉毕竟只是她的杂念，既然是杂念，她不愿好好安置也算情有可原。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎！你轻一点，它们刚刚吃饱，不能这么倒着提起来！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿咬","speakerId":"avg_npc_1422_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘎呕——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赶快拿瓶子装起来，不能浪费了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都给我——出去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊、啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么拿着剑画——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g26_dusk_wild"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"画啊啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——啊！我的屁股！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们怎么......你们还好吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"齐尔查克","speakerId":"avg_4144_chilc_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳......我在这，我没事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老夫也没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里......能闻到海的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森西","speakerId":"avg_4143_sensi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们来到海边了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，但至少，我们应该是离开那里了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不对，等等，我还没来得及和它们道别呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"结果还是靠莱欧斯对魔物的爱来解决的啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，玛露西尔，你的嘴上......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你嘴上怎么黑黑的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莱欧斯","speakerId":"avg_4142_laios_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你其实最后还是没忍住也吃了，对不对！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯？......不对啊，你们也是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗呸呸呸！这是什么味道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玛露西尔","speakerId":"avg_4141_marcil_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们刚刚这是吃了什么？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这幅画是不能要了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒觉得他们很有意思......你不尝尝吗？还有这些山楂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黎","speakerId":"avg_npc_139","isRemote":false,"text":"尝一口呗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"夕","speakerId":"avgnew_2015_dusk_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不吃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
